    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/c3f3cf3ab7eff3e270abb9b507cc4b3d.poster.avif?t=1754927268\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/c3f3cf3ab7eff3e270abb9b507cc4b3d.webm?t=1754927268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/c3f3cf3ab7eff3e270abb9b507cc4b3d.mp4?t=1754927268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start on an epic adventure of square proportions! Explore mysterious zones, conquer challenging puzzles, and engage in thrilling battles with fierce foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the full potential of your hero by collecting powerful items scattered throughout the land. The greatest of adventurers will discover hidden treasures waiting for only the bravest of explorers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/c96c83e9cae49900569f592f11b6812c.avif?t=1754927268\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry bullets!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once discovered, the <i>Parry Bullet</i> power allows you to parry incoming bullets and reflect them back at enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/00fd1f182bb2fbcd42d067a163d92948.poster.avif?t=1754927268\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/00fd1f182bb2fbcd42d067a163d92948.webm?t=1754927268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/00fd1f182bb2fbcd42d067a163d92948.mp4?t=1754927268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore for secrets!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does it look like a good fit? In HeroSquare secrets are everywhere, and good positioning is the key to many of them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/f149500fedeb685ef7cf708fcbeed7f9.poster.avif?t=1754927268\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/f149500fedeb685ef7cf708fcbeed7f9.webm?t=1754927268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/f149500fedeb685ef7cf708fcbeed7f9.mp4?t=1754927268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power up!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your adventure you will add new abilities and upgrades to your arsenal. Master them to reach the finale of HeroSquare!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/9420fe936925df3a5e14db8fd3ec9f97.poster.avif?t=1754927268\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/9420fe936925df3a5e14db8fd3ec9f97.webm?t=1754927268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/9420fe936925df3a5e14db8fd3ec9f97.mp4?t=1754927268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Triumph in battle!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face tough bosses determined to stop your progress. However there's always a way forward, especially if one looks around a bit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/30754436a724dd07827f36f46b8dcf1b.poster.avif?t=1754927268\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/30754436a724dd07827f36f46b8dcf1b.webm?t=1754927268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/30754436a724dd07827f36f46b8dcf1b.mp4?t=1754927268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/050b274886784e8d36b99e8fbbda0bc1.avif?t=1754927268\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We find our hero stranded under the stars. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you ended up here is a mystery, and so is the exact nature of this colorful world, that you find yourself in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One memory however remains, something once had, but now lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere in this world, a heart awaits...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/eafc4d49fe93358ce8d6fcfcc012278a.poster.avif?t=1754927268\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/eafc4d49fe93358ce8d6fcfcc012278a.webm?t=1754927268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/eafc4d49fe93358ce8d6fcfcc012278a.mp4?t=1754927268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/39ea6ee1438b578e0a62b65a06a0f151.avif?t=1754927268\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience metroidvania like it's 1982</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 large zones, each with unique enemies, power ups and puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful visuals pulsing with an arcade glow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple intuitive controls (keyboard or gamepad supported!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack with a unique chiptune style created for HeroSquare + handcrafted sound fx</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/eda2d34d92ba9c533ce285bdbb0e346a.avif?t=1754927268\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/c3f3cf3ab7eff3e270abb9b507cc4b3d.poster.avif?t=1754927268\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/c3f3cf3ab7eff3e270abb9b507cc4b3d.webm?t=1754927268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/c3f3cf3ab7eff3e270abb9b507cc4b3d.mp4?t=1754927268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start on an epic adventure of square proportions! Explore mysterious zones, conquer challenging puzzles, and engage in thrilling battles with fierce foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the full potential of your hero by collecting powerful items scattered throughout the land. The greatest of adventurers will discover hidden treasures waiting for only the bravest of explorers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/c96c83e9cae49900569f592f11b6812c.avif?t=1754927268\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry bullets!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once discovered, the <i>Parry Bullet</i> power allows you to parry incoming bullets and reflect them back at enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/00fd1f182bb2fbcd42d067a163d92948.poster.avif?t=1754927268\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/00fd1f182bb2fbcd42d067a163d92948.webm?t=1754927268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/00fd1f182bb2fbcd42d067a163d92948.mp4?t=1754927268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore for secrets!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does it look like a good fit? In HeroSquare secrets are everywhere, and good positioning is the key to many of them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/f149500fedeb685ef7cf708fcbeed7f9.poster.avif?t=1754927268\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/f149500fedeb685ef7cf708fcbeed7f9.webm?t=1754927268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/f149500fedeb685ef7cf708fcbeed7f9.mp4?t=1754927268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power up!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your adventure you will add new abilities and upgrades to your arsenal. Master them to reach the finale of HeroSquare!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/9420fe936925df3a5e14db8fd3ec9f97.poster.avif?t=1754927268\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/9420fe936925df3a5e14db8fd3ec9f97.webm?t=1754927268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/9420fe936925df3a5e14db8fd3ec9f97.mp4?t=1754927268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 