m; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/eafc4d49fe93358ce8d6fcfcc012278a.mp4?t=1754927268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/39ea6ee1438b578e0a62b65a06a0f151.avif?t=1754927268\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience metroidvania like it's 1982</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 large zones, each with unique enemies, power ups and puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful visuals pulsing with an arcade glow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple intuitive controls (keyboard or gamepad supported!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack with a unique chiptune style created for HeroSquare + handcrafted sound fx</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/eda2d34d92ba9c533ce285bdbb0e346a.avif?t=1754927268\" /></span></p>",
